{"body_markdown":"","change_reason":"依据原固定证据整理v3技术块和独立文档，结论与科学复核状态不变","content_hash":"9df4049ddc4fde132da387f46c40fec3659891379cd8234c43d49ffa55d28506","created_at":"2026-09-08T22:09:00.547490Z","created_by":{"id":"codex-development-agent-default-skill-acceptance","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"workspace_summary","keywords":["浮点求和","数值稳定性","detail"],"kind":"detail","level":"L1","owner_id":"RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","payload":{"blocks":[{"block_id":"inputs","markdown":"## 设计与采样\n\n将三项序列$[10^{16},1,-10^{16}]$重复10次，得到30项多重集合。每个样本含10个正大数、10个1和10个负大数，精确和均为10；对这一集合保存30种排列。\n\n| 参数 | 取值 | 用途与范围 |\n|---|---:|---|\n| 大数幅值 | $10^{16}$ | 保持前两组的舍入尺度 |\n| 三项重复次数 | 10 | 小量精确总和为10 |\n| 每个排列项数 | 30 | 有限长度，不检验长序列极限 |\n| 排列样本数 | 30 | 不是总体失败概率估计 |\n| 随机种子 | 20260909 | 固定采样配方，复核优先读取保存数组 |\n\n原配方创建`rng = random.Random(20260909)`，每次重置`values = ['1e16', '1', '-1e16'] * 10`，再调用`rng.shuffle(values)`；30次连续使用同一个随机数生成器。已有独立采样核对表明，在所记录的Python环境中，生成的30组、每组30项数组与保存输入逐项一致。其他Python版本不能仅凭同一seed推断排列完全相同。","requires_block_ids":[],"role":"inputs"},{"block_id":"checks","markdown":"## 计算与检查\n\n读取固定数组后，对每组运行与第二组相同的四种实现。逐项累加、Kahan和Neumaier保存每一步的当前和、补偿值与精确前缀误差；math.fsum仅保留实际返回值。每个输出按独立方法章计算相对于精确和10的绝对误差，不用浮点容差判定精确性。\n\n本轮共120个方法输出已在后续复核中与原结果逐项比较。下表和图保留全部30个样本的汇总，不挑选单个有利排列。","requires_block_ids":["inputs"],"role":"methods"},{"block_id":"results","markdown":"## 结果与误差分布\n\n| 方法 | 精确命中/样本数 | 最大绝对误差 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 显式逐项累加 | 0/30 | 10 |\n| Kahan | 5/30 | 10 |\n| Neumaier | 30/30 | 0 |\n| math.fsum | 30/30 | 0 |\n\n![30组固定排列的精确命中数与最大绝对误差](figure:0)\n\n| 方法 | 绝对误差 → 出现次数 |\n|---|---|\n| 显式逐项累加 | 2 → 1；4 → 1；5 → 2；6 → 5；8 → 2；9 → 4；10 → 15 |\n| Kahan | 0 → 5；1 → 2；2 → 12；4 → 2；5 → 4；6 → 4；10 → 1 |\n| Neumaier | 0 → 30 |\n| math.fsum | 0 → 30 |\n\n![全部30个保存排列的绝对误差序列；纵轴无量纲](figure:1)\n\nKahan在5组排列中精确，在另外25组中仍有误差；其中1组的绝对误差达到10。因此，增加项数后，所选抵消结构仍能产生反例。Neumaier与math.fsum本次30组均精确，但这仍是有限构造样本，不能估计真实数据分布上的失败概率，也没有覆盖非整数、极端指数或运行时间。","requires_block_ids":["inputs"],"role":"results"}],"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"16afde15315ac4f45463c1f3124a3e7d886398e8c09c6fb9adfdc19e43bd228d","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-DETAIL-R03","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"1db68adb0974c4e43d572b9d8c6956c0cd941ca74effbc1769da27febb7f5408","target_id":"RUN-20260908T201240Z-90107A617CF8","target_kind":"owner"},{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"8efe2879a142667db6d174693fc5738228e9904902d7a2c884e720d75d014b05","target_id":"RUN-20260908T215458Z-04C7D84D40D8","target_kind":"owner"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"9da1f46663a569680b3e61e842f164880d24c047e0ab13ac0471df6683d32561","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-INPUT-R03","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"739d2ce2c6922dc7ce74dfea9ac22d987dd6b8d353484e70c615fc96d2f22074","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-TRACE-VERIFY","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"d7348aca67bf17dc4369a7b8d756b2193571b8c6f7010cc0efb6557ef409da8c","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-OP-TRACES","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"7759b89aa016be03e7f18169240dd308c28b21bfafac980c92cbce36bfeeaeee","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-FIGURE-R03","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"0fdc0ea6ef408adaf2c7c5c2e56fd0f72e95db032a30d5fc344e3cf9e21bd456","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-FIGURE-PERMUTATIONS","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"8fc77120e5495b853becd8d160ae84f8c135318eec5dda1f8108b68dd5dfc52d","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-SAMPLING-VERIFY","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"bf89c9889ac3795214b21b6a3d19557750da1304fc60fb58d63d119784e7ceed","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-REPORT-V2-METHODS","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"be64d72d7648d1463ab8e007d18b98